      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why only for directed acyclic graph? : if a graph\nis 1 → 2 and 2 → 1(undirected) or 1 → 2, 2 →\n3, 3 → 1(cyclic) there is no linear ordering\npossible",
