      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why only for directed acyclic graph? : if a graph is 1 → 2 and 2 → 1(undirected) or 1 → 2, 2 → 3, 3 → 1(cyclic) there is no linear ordering possible",
