    {
      "id": "p8lc5U6xQL0d_hLb5FVXm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8936.596505984344,
      "y": -2857.4340478325307,
      "width": 759.75927734375,
      "height": 40,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1651015055,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 485339106,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272864614,
      "created": 1793270913591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Spanning tree - A tree in which we have N nodes and N-1 edges and all nodes are reachable from\neach other",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Spanning tree - A tree in which we have N nodes and N-1 edges and all nodes are reachable from each other",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "tGHQBiMzCB3JLQSKOFvgK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9085.34836755661,
      "y": -2797.4340478325307,
      "width": 462.25555419921875,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 882058977,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 904869694,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272864614,
      "created": 1793270913591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- A spanning tree with minimum sum is minimum spanning tree",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- A spanning tree with minimum sum is minimum spanning tree",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xcaQOFehvHATey4-4qIem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9001.90043054489,
      "y": -2737.4340478325307,
      "width": 629.1514282226562,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1858073519,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1295082402,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272864614,
      "created": 1793270913591,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1-> If each edge has a distinct weight then there will be only one & unique MST.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1-> If each edge has a distinct weight then there will be only one & unique MST.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "BmwbunQHedvJSD_KEmuqk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8919.572427615203,
      "y": -2727.4340478325307,
      "width": 793.8074340820312,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1412276929,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1673633662,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272864614,
      "created": 1793270913592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2-> A complete undirected graph can have n^(n-2) number of Spanning Trees. For example : Consider a\ntriangle which have 3 vertices and 3 edges so n=3 || 3^(3-2) => 3. Hence , it would have 3 spanning\ntrees.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2-> A complete undirected graph can have n^(n-2) number of Spanning Trees. For example : Consider a triangle which have 3 vertices and 3 edges so n=3 || 3^(3-2) => 3. Hence , it would have 3 spanning trees.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "mOD-oQxXrZXO-cVnc9fjW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 8956.412423953094,
      "y": -2637.4340478325307,
      "width": 720.12744140625,
      "height": 20,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dotted",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bbX",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 151233999,
      "version": 66,
      "versionNonce": 1783144290,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793272864614,
      "created": 1793270913592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3-> From a Complete graph by removing max(e-n+1) edges, we can construct a Spanning Tree.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3-> From a Complete graph by removing max(e-n+1) edges, we can construct a Spanning Tree.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
